otengine/godot/pull/108168.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-14T20:28:29Z"},"body":"Previously SceneTreeDock didn't allow to move selected nodes up and down (Ctrl + Up/Down by default) when they have different parents. The code suggests that this was intentional, but I don't like it. I don't see any issues with moving nodes with different parents.\r\nSo to implement this, I just removed the limitation that was there before. Also, to get selected nodes it uses now `get_full_selected_node_list)` instead of `get_top_selected_node_list()`, so you can move a node and its children at the same time. This is the only change I'm not sure about. But right now I would prefer this approach over the previous one.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3606dd8-8eb5-436a-b7c9-a10c0dbbe116\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108168/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108168/ti